      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e11d7258b79ed2c5461e2e94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞！要铆足干劲地上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d9f3fe5c2be9042863b24526c7ffce261e060fe7317a765701597266d4ba655",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad54351aade6e81cd566a581",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "单挑的对手是、全体观众！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcfd350e5384baefa8c4c22cda4ebfba165069989882aea1f23dc77a6c889960",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:358c0d3b5a76ef93e079928e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算只是游戏也要鼓足干劲加油哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5db5e979260e7204d8ab7a040aa52bb8c1d470923c8a6f4be252ef7a27ab520",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47dd0b245e55d65b6885913e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今往后我也会和形形色色的人单挑的哦！\r\n你可要好好跟上我啊、训练公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9ed96a68c5a11a58e0b76b52bbde1daf47a64f6bd0e0859fc150d9311239a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cf3b6a2d7e4a35cabce2dd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，还蛮适合我的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7a6424b82239325e26b0b807ea78ce6107603650e45103c01a162ca5c870fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44f7b7849d04a3231e5d0953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然设计是我不太习惯的那种……\r\n但还不差啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd0a291f384124f3c347f8fd790091dd0f74a742c0ca8efa330dfe3d61d6c9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd11425bd01e632343089964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然只要穿着这身的话情绪会高涨起来呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "333c5b7cc242a67c315dc6c5ba8229db8160f992fcc930302ddb242fcaa6b9b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40bd6514415a4e6cc9f5a963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件制服即轻快、又很方便活动身体呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23dd90e047fda5a9ef25124ff0aaa21b251db0359215f4cda04fdc66b5ddba63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d9b6ed84bac72ec23379222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为设计太可爱了，所以稍微觉得有点害羞呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3011401b87336164ac4e20df372956d1f6dbbba699674c61bb7e8b57389bce4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1da397b1588dafa168e321b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿着这身的话、\r\n就会变得像来场热烈的比赛了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "161fd72a5f3a4811bf89d9f1be9adc3716cc4725f5c28a4d5cb0953d6d2cb2aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2503da21ea73948ee5bd8304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你做好紧跟着「女杰」的\r\n心理准备了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "604ea264f7619e498342ececf6cbbb23a01d62d5d53ab6ab1b15a9ce4ae7f7c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3ccefeb3fad8f3290a324d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机会难得，我们两个\r\n把蛋糕切一切分来吃吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0265d7c78da53c9e082cf0f17581b61f21921ffa78e507c3bf728c184d285fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ad8641e635666145ddf71c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f913ac6ea8110821d188785bd378043d1e5921f031c98c1bb24b8b64a2253bb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3b0fa32de368305c869897c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要单挑的话我随时奉陪哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75cf3da6e8a74ee88921b84114c000e5a4ace0a3d47051853f86c3490375af33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:149dd13ad91870013460d428",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃えるような赤だろ？\r\nへへっ、気に入ってるのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d226f92365adf4ccf9801e607f82ad51c46dd9d55c3cea24c7b9df5e7eb50ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18010a52a42686970b387b98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さーて、出かけるよ。\r\n買う物がたくさんあるんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b2de466ea8c3f076f206253d43c51c4bba95a1f036d33565d3e6f015d46cf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41241d356ab197f57a36aac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，还蛮适合我的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7a6424b82239325e26b0b807ea78ce6107603650e45103c01a162ca5c870fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
