        "1012",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b41c9d8d9aa0d2973023c2cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然只要穿着这身的话情绪会高涨起来呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "333c5b7cc242a67c315dc6c5ba8229db8160f992fcc930302ddb242fcaa6b9b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de5cf0ddd895f0d77d3b2bc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件制服即轻快、又很方便活动身体呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23dd90e047fda5a9ef25124ff0aaa21b251db0359215f4cda04fdc66b5ddba63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8812312cd1a3005c4a5d5893",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为设计太可爱了，所以稍微觉得有点害羞呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3011401b87336164ac4e20df372956d1f6dbbba699674c61bb7e8b57389bce4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdb6f38ae041234f4fbdb8c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿着这身的话、\r\n就会变得像来场热烈的比赛了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "161fd72a5f3a4811bf89d9f1be9adc3716cc4725f5c28a4d5cb0953d6d2cb2aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49dc3bb4d5a85b3893f1a313",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你做好紧跟着「女杰」的\r\n心理准备了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "604ea264f7619e498342ececf6cbbb23a01d62d5d53ab6ab1b15a9ce4ae7f7c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4e95de779a61c18defa487d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机会难得，我们两个\r\n把蛋糕切一切分来吃吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0265d7c78da53c9e082cf0f17581b61f21921ffa78e507c3bf728c184d285fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b47792aa648306a0fb9bc41b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f913ac6ea8110821d188785bd378043d1e5921f031c98c1bb24b8b64a2253bb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6dcf1d27ea321ffd59a1d72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要单挑的话我随时奉陪哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75cf3da6e8a74ee88921b84114c000e5a4ace0a3d47051853f86c3490375af33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbea1ab8271e4eba69cf538e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:914b9909da49cce257fc88cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要和我一决胜负吗？\r\n行啊，放马过来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4d2a6efb785cab417238248ff26d4f07e4913a335f35e6fb929897a7de19b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af697010df25767c2581897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始变得有趣起来了啊！\r\n那么，我可要动真格了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7872cacc131ac98acf48821ac036fa248c719430f06485efc73ad73b61055d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b9882b8e744e9b4fdbfcd0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好啊、训练公！\r\n你看上去很精神就比什么都好啦。\r\n精神不饱满的话可算不上一天之始呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "135306fe7a96d358214281b97be42b3688139383f7a875fa0a0c803b01f1ff6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d959e2f915edb3923c403055",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别犯迷糊了、给我清醒一点呀。\r\n你要是不昂首挺胸的话，还怎么做表率啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0569516dc6fc467b5c0af6193b94b3c06da37ffe523f7d2c3e56275499def42e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2368005a58382e9c57d60f24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜、嗝……真没想到会有人向我发出\r\n大胃王挑战呢……\r\n我也、得锻炼一下胃容量才行了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16f3360c3a6f324e5baa8d37c5ecb7d1f8369ae6df73aadec2e247ea77c2c08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1e5c70046a8634c30f4ec87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不就稍微睡个午觉吧。\r\n毕竟到下午又得要继续加油了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ac10385ca371ea095fe1b756013f80b94f417dfda6fa13733c5451339b10f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:557a24a910b5a69e22bce953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么——又到了我最辛苦的时候了呢……\r\n要是大伙都能遵守门禁时间就好了啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a842a0222027ff779991feb390afe88ea0f156afae46ec7453133334da5bae7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbd306a7183ae45f17739244",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，看上去还在努力工作呢。\r\n但是、可别太勉强自己了啊。\r\n和菱亚马逊姐约好了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7594a01f9bdd4ec121b89e03bf6d2764a22612ce27b211bb5eb9fca07edb13a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6325af96e839f26a5a3e1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早春的空气就是让人心情舒畅啊！\r\n训练公，洗衣服的话就趁着还早吧！\r\n我也会来搭把手的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde76050736355e00ee2b81a045db8dec74f91f46cf8eb9d66d2550b95a10242",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2674616de3b3e475219f9d08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节可得好好补充水分哦。\r\n啊……不过、只是单纯补水的话可不行哟？\r\n盐分也得一起好好地摄取才行",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d75fb0340e1ccca8fd2df22b2301642466ddc8f17d6e82b754f475a9dfaf6bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf8e6187e629d7afc7146372",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到秋天的时候太阳就会落的很快呢。\r\n所以要做的事、\r\n就趁着天还亮着的时候赶紧做好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ecf913ad9a412b22edd39b09c4e1061fbe603e96eae05735fb61a30b3668f61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc16a0cdf84a7ebf5f5f27df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的话喝点姜汤会比较好哦。\r\n喝完之后心里都变得暖洋洋的、\r\n无论天气有多冷都没问题了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d830eda4cab9b67b9eec28119dec242d5f6b31ac54d69e9a898c468d75ec39fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:241b3fd8d6517cd5363abf91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你喜欢吃甜的还是咸的玉子烧？\r\n今天就由大姐我\r\n帮你做一份特制便当！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2e11300dc4b0f65167e7ef78058be2219ac8f4f8fcbc5d2599e0806404c45cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b738677370b64eb1ac228f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要好好加油啊。\r\n──喔，等等！……真是的。\r\n你看，领子皱掉了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1166fb30626a5248513d2580fa6bf5a4ba4d49b86a5682419acc81e6e170cbb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3be5552dccdd9817a9b042c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～！逼白仁吃蔬菜\r\n花了我不少时间！\r\n好啦，我也来吃午饭吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "526b5f9bb47b097ea6ef5cf6d4cfecc8a74e45d321b3ad695c218439efa831d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f342c3d6ee232d7f7a9979a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要去我老家的大众食堂？\r\n午餐的菜单有你应该会\r\n喜欢的定食哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4601203fc0c6dcaceec89daeeb6de1dc347a497f11261ff7cfddd6c29602072",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ec31637c601bc036cedf78f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说伏特加和赤骥\r\n还没回到宿舍。真是……\r\n我去操场看看好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "935dd9ac5a64ccc0630a3126f9c87d5cd7afa590be803bfcd814404ef3caeae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f649c83e19c724806bf30fc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也辛苦啦！\r\n别熬夜了，快去睡吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eaccd5b9c8238a69f2625c3873f9c7246c81e563e85e23039bf002da064bf1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:871e85d1751dfe2816376787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也该去赏花了吧。\r\n饭团的馅料……\r\n就放一堆你爱吃的东西吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc25352605b1f368c594349ec5997e3ee97d0b6323e1eacf50cd760a9f723063",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5906abf83f0f207215f19807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别看这套衣服很普通，它的\r\n快干效果超好的！这个时期衣服\r\n很快就干可是帮了我大忙。嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d9c2df0fa472104b83e414fcde4817f22a9bc613c8d6659736807a92bf91b31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31f8bcf713e1941155e6d69f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大概是因为秋天到，宿舍的学生\r\n很容易饿，白饭一下就被吃光了！\r\n不过，有精神是好事啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36890f0b3681bf05128dde26027e82473829ce596319424ccf06f070605e64fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:174ba2d2fff54d5578098622",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～冷死了！\r\n今天一定要吃火锅！\r\n加一堆姜和胡萝卜的热腾腾火锅！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d039140a1c91c1e69bda4d69c6f6e52a99b9a25d215181ad70e4e396653ec550",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36531b7b74970ee81a7f5838",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00ca9e7ad20a67e5e00c5da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb4e7b23cbe50f205ace0927",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次想给宿舍里的小家伙们的衣服上\r\n绣上刺绣章的时候她们就都跑开了啊\r\n……就那么讨厌吗、青虫的刺绣章。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef140e01e9b7b6e576795bc1238672db850aa14562b32006c442f363bdeb1d32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
